Origin:

Optional GPIO14/15 console after recursive RP1 PCI enumeration. Build
with -D RP1_UART_CONSOLE=TRUE. Use a 50 MHz UART clock at 115200 8N1.
The diagnostic console uses GPIO only. SPCR uses the dynamically assigned
RP1 UART0 address, without an interrupt; the native DSDT UART is unchanged.
Cm5PlatformStage records platform init (1), ReadyToBoot start (3) and
completion (4) in the existing firmware variable store for USB inspection.

